  "cross_tradition_view": "Most of these traditions would likely value respecting boundaries, avoiding damage, and recognizing the owner’s anger. They may split over whether acting without asking is only discourteous or also unjust; the AI chooses the more permissive view and treats the cuttings as a separate matter of poor form.",
  "rubric_problems": [
    "The dialogue gives no jurisdiction, although the answer relies on a general claim about common-law rules; the legal rule and local customs could materially differ.",
